{"seq":3,"slug":"compose-multiplatform","title":"Compose Multiplatform 跨平台开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/compose-multiplatform","wordCount":612,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"compose-multiplatform-跨平台开发\">Compose Multiplatform 跨平台开发</h1><p>Compose Multiplatform（CMP）由 JetBrains 维护，将 Jetpack Compose 的声明式 UI 模型从 Android 扩展到 iOS、Desktop（JVM）和 Web（Kotlin/Wasm）。截至 2026 年 6 月，CMP 1.11 基于 Jetpack Compose Runtime/UI 1.8+，实现了 iOS 并发渲染默认启用、原生文本输入、v2 UI 测试 API，以及 Web 端滚动性能的全面对齐。本文深入 CMP 的架构分层、平台适配策略和实际工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CMP 的架构核心是<strong>共享 Compose Runtime + 平台特定渲染后端</strong>：所有平台共享同一套 Composition/State/Recomposition 机制，但渲染管线在不同平台使用不同实现——Android 用原生 Canvas，iOS/Desktop/Web 用 Skia（通过 Skiko 绑定）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 共享层&#10;        A[Compose Runtime] --&gt; B[Composition / Slot Table]&#10;        A --&gt; C[Snapshot System]&#10;        A --&gt; D[Recomposer]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 平台渲染&#10;        E[&quot;Android: HWUI Canvas&quot;]&#10;        F[&quot;iOS: Skia via Skiko + UIKit&quot;]&#10;        G[&quot;Desktop: Skia via Skiko + AWT/JWM&quot;]&#10;        H[&quot;Web: Skia via Kotlin/Wasm&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt; G&#10;    B --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    subgraph 共享层\n        A[Compose Runtime] --&gt; B[Composition / Slot Table]\n        A --&gt; C[Snapshot System]\n        A --&gt; D[Recomposer]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 平台渲染\n        E[\"Android: HWUI Canvas\"]\n        F[\"iOS: Skia via Skiko + UIKit\"]\n        G[\"Desktop: Skia via Skiko + AWT/JWM\"]\n        H[\"Web: Skia via Kotlin/Wasm\"]\n    end\n\n    B --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; F\n    B --&gt; G\n    B --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>渲染后端</th>\n<th>UI 集成</th>\n<th>成熟度 (2026)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>原生 HWUI</td>\n<td>Jetpack Compose 原生</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td>Skiko (Metal)</td>\n<td>UIViewController 容器</td>\n<td>Stable (1.8+)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Desktop</td>\n<td>Skiko (OpenGL/Metal/DirectX)</td>\n<td>AWT Window / JWM</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web</td>\n<td>Kotlin/Wasm + Canvas</td>\n<td>DOM Canvas 元素</td>\n<td>Beta</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"项目结构与依赖配置\">项目结构与依赖配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// settings.gradle.kts (典型 KMP + CMP 项目)&#10;pluginManagement {&#10;    repositories {&#10;        google()&#10;        mavenCentral()&#10;        gradlePluginPortal()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// build.gradle.kts (共享模块)&#10;plugins {&#10;    kotlin(&quot;multiplatform&quot;)&#10;    id(&quot;org.jetbrains.compose&quot;) version &quot;1.11.1&quot;&#10;    id(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose&quot;) version &quot;2.1.20&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;kotlin {&#10;    androidTarget()&#10;    iosArm64()&#10;    iosSimulatorArm64()&#10;    jvm(&quot;desktop&quot;)&#10;&#10;    sourceSets {&#10;        commonMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(compose.runtime)&#10;            implementation(compose.foundation)&#10;            implementation(compose.material3)&#10;            implementation(compose.components.resources)&#10;&#10;            // 跨平台导航&#10;            implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.androidx.navigation:navigation-compose:2.9.0-beta03&quot;)&#10;            // 跨平台生命周期&#10;            implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.androidx.lifecycle:lifecycle-viewmodel-compose:2.9.0&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        androidMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(&quot;androidx.activity:activity-compose:1.9.3&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        iosMain.dependencies {&#10;            // iOS 平台特定依赖&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// settings.gradle.kts (典型 KMP + CMP 项目)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pluginManagement {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repositories {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        google()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mavenCentral()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gradlePluginPortal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts (共享模块)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"multiplatform\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"org.jetbrains.compose\") version \"1.11.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose\") version \"2.1.20\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    androidTarget()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    iosArm64()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    iosSimulatorArm64()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jvm(\"desktop\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sourceSets {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        commonMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(compose.runtime)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(compose.foundation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(compose.material3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(compose.components.resources)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 跨平台导航</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"org.jetbrains.androidx.navigation:navigation-compose:2.9.0-beta03\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 跨平台生命周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"org.jetbrains.androidx.lifecycle:lifecycle-viewmodel-compose:2.9.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        androidMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"androidx.activity:activity-compose:1.9.3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        iosMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // iOS 平台特定依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"资源管理\">资源管理</h2><p>CMP 1.6+ 引入统一的多平台资源系统，取代了各平台独立的资源方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain/composeResources/&#10;// ├── drawable/&#10;// │   └── logo.png&#10;// ├── values/&#10;// │   ├── strings.xml          (默认语言)&#10;// │   └── strings-zh.xml      (中文)&#10;// └── font/&#10;//     └── roboto_regular.ttf&#10;&#10;// 代码中使用（自动生成 Res 对象）&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppLogo() {&#10;    Image(&#10;        painter = painterResource(Res.drawable.logo),&#10;        contentDescription = null&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun Greeting() {&#10;    Text(text = stringResource(Res.string.hello_world))&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 字体加载&#10;val RobotoFamily = FontFamily(Font(Res.font.roboto_regular))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain/composeResources/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ├── drawable/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// │   └── logo.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ├── values/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// │   ├── strings.xml          (默认语言)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// │   └── strings-zh.xml      (中文)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// └── font/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     └── roboto_regular.ttf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代码中使用（自动生成 Res 对象）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppLogo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Image(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        painter = painterResource(Res.drawable.logo),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentDescription = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Greeting() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Text(text = stringResource(Res.string.hello_world))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 字体加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val RobotoFamily = FontFamily(Font(Res.font.roboto_regular))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"平台特定代码-expect-actual\">平台特定代码：expect/actual</h2><p>当需要访问平台 API 时使用 Kotlin 的 expect/actual 机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect class PlatformContext&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;expect fun rememberPlatformContext(): PlatformContext&#10;&#10;expect fun PlatformContext.shareText(text: String)&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual typealias PlatformContext = Context&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;actual fun rememberPlatformContext(): PlatformContext {&#10;    return LocalContext.current&#10;}&#10;&#10;actual fun PlatformContext.shareText(text: String) {&#10;    val intent = Intent(Intent.ACTION_SEND).apply {&#10;        type = &quot;text/plain&quot;&#10;        putExtra(Intent.EXTRA_TEXT, text)&#10;    }&#10;    startActivity(Intent.createChooser(intent, null))&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual class PlatformContext(val viewController: UIViewController)&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;actual fun rememberPlatformContext(): PlatformContext {&#10;    val vc = LocalUIViewController.current&#10;    return remember { PlatformContext(vc) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;actual fun PlatformContext.shareText(text: String) {&#10;    val activityVC = UIActivityViewController(&#10;        activityItems = listOf(text),&#10;        applicationActivities = null&#10;    )&#10;    viewController.presentViewController(activityVC, animated = true, completion = null)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect class PlatformContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun rememberPlatformContext(): PlatformContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun PlatformContext.shareText(text: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual typealias PlatformContext = Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun rememberPlatformContext(): PlatformContext {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return LocalContext.current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun PlatformContext.shareText(text: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val intent = Intent(Intent.ACTION_SEND).apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        type = \"text/plain\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        putExtra(Intent.EXTRA_TEXT, text)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startActivity(Intent.createChooser(intent, null))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class PlatformContext(val viewController: UIViewController)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun rememberPlatformContext(): PlatformContext {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val vc = LocalUIViewController.current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return remember { PlatformContext(vc) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun PlatformContext.shareText(text: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val activityVC = UIActivityViewController(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        activityItems = listOf(text),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        applicationActivities = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewController.presentViewController(activityVC, animated = true, completion = null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ios-集成最佳实践\">iOS 集成最佳实践</h2><p>CMP 1.11 的 iOS 支持已达生产级：并发渲染默认启用、原生文本输入可选启用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// iOS 入口（iosMain）&#10;fun MainViewController(): UIViewController {&#10;    return ComposeUIViewController(&#10;        configure = {&#10;            // 1.11：并发渲染已默认启用，无需配置&#10;            // 原生文本输入（实验性）&#10;            platformLayers = true&#10;        }&#10;    ) {&#10;        App()  // 共享的根 Composable&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Swift 端集成（iOS 项目）&#10;// ContentView.swift&#10;struct ComposeView: UIViewControllerRepresentable {&#10;    func makeUIViewController(context: Context) -&gt; UIViewController {&#10;        MainViewControllerKt.MainViewController()&#10;    }&#10;    func updateUIViewController(_ vc: UIViewController, context: Context) {}&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 与 UIKit 组件互操作&#10;@Composable&#10;fun MapView(location: LatLng) {&#10;    UIKitView(&#10;        factory = {&#10;            MKMapView().apply {&#10;                val annotation = MKPointAnnotation()&#10;                annotation.coordinate = CLLocationCoordinate2D(&#10;                    latitude = location.lat,&#10;                    longitude = location.lng&#10;                )&#10;                addAnnotation(annotation)&#10;            }&#10;        },&#10;        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize()&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// iOS 入口（iosMain）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun MainViewController(): UIViewController {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ComposeUIViewController(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        configure = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 1.11：并发渲染已默认启用，无需配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 原生文本输入（实验性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            platformLayers = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        App()  // 共享的根 Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Swift 端集成（iOS 项目）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ContentView.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ComposeView: UIViewControllerRepresentable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    func makeUIViewController(context: Context) -> UIViewController {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MainViewControllerKt.MainViewController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    func updateUIViewController(_ vc: UIViewController, context: Context) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 与 UIKit 组件互操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun MapView(location: LatLng) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    UIKitView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        factory = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            MKMapView().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val annotation = MKPointAnnotation()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                annotation.coordinate = CLLocationCoordinate2D(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    latitude = location.lat,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    longitude = location.lng</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                addAnnotation(annotation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"1-11-新特性速览\">1.11 新特性速览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原生文本输入</td>\n<td>基于 UIView 的文本编辑，支持自动填充/翻译/搜索</td>\n<td>iOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发渲染默认启用</td>\n<td>渲染任务卸载到专用线程</td>\n<td>iOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 测试 v2</td>\n<td>StandardTestDispatcher + effectContext 参数</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动对齐原生</td>\n<td>触摸处理重写，滚动手感与原生 UI 一致</td>\n<td>Web</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Variable fonts</td>\n<td>支持可变字体轴调整</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shader 解耦</td>\n<td>Shader 不再直接依赖 Skia 类型</td>\n<td>非 Android</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CMP 共享 Compose Runtime 层，平台差异仅在渲染后端（Android HWUI / 其他平台 Skia）</li>\n<li>统一资源系统（<code>composeResources/</code>）取代各平台独立资源方案，编译期生成类型安全访问</li>\n<li><code>expect/actual</code> 处理平台特定能力，保持共享代码最大化</li>\n<li>iOS 支持已达生产级：并发渲染、原生文本输入、UIKit 互操作</li>\n<li>从 Kotlin 2.1.0 / CMP 1.8 起完全迁移到 K2 编译器，与旧 K1 库不兼容</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"compose-compiler-internals\">Compose 编译器原理</a>——编译器插件如何适配多平台后端</li>\n<li><a href=\"performance-optimization\">性能优化实战</a>——跨平台场景下的性能测量与 Baseline Profile</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/kmp-setup\">Kotlin 进阶 · KMP 配置</a>——Kotlin Multiplatform 项目结构与 Gradle 配置</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Compose Multiplatform 跨平台开发","id":"compose-multiplatform-跨平台开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"项目结构与依赖配置","id":"项目结构与依赖配置"},{"level":2,"text":"资源管理","id":"资源管理"},{"level":2,"text":"平台特定代码：expect/actual","id":"平台特定代码-expect-actual"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 集成最佳实践","id":"ios-集成最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"1.11 新特性速览","id":"1-11-新特性速览"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"性能优化实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/advanced/performance-optimization"},"next":null}